{"des":"奇瓦-魔法材料学","script":"yd_019_07","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","x":100,"y":-423.20000000000005,"img":"chara019_1","scaleY":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","transTime":300,"x":100,"y":-423.20000000000005,"img":"chara019_1","scaleY":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]你作为工匠，对于各种材料的性质应该很了解吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]这么说来，我们在这方面应该很有共同语言才对。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]毕竟我在大书院也学习了魔法材料学的相关课程，对于这些事情也非常了解！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]之所以会学这个，是因为我契约了软软，想着操纵火焰是不是对于研究材料比较有帮助……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]但导师告诉我，魔法材料学已经死了！因为现在发现新材料完全都是靠炼金合成！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]大家完全不用了解材料为什么有这些性质，只需要赌上素材等着撞大运就行了，[r]魔法材料学也因此变成了夕阳学科……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]唉，说多了都是泪，希望我学的这些东西，在这边还有点用武之地吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}